+## Budgets
+
+Budgets are monthly spending limits per category, stored in `budgets.txt`.
+`tally budget status` shows, for each budgeted category, the limit, what was
+spent in the month (expenses only), what remains, the share used, and a
+status: `ok`, `warning` once spending reaches `budget.warn_percent` of the
+limit, or `over` when spending exceeds it. Renaming a category moves its
+budget along with its entries.
